DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260530
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270928
DTSTAMP:20260928T182614Z
UID:6dd843ddb452791725e779cb996f@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Exhibition open Wednesday through Sunday from 10am to 4pm with
  free parking and admission. As of America’s 250th anniversary\, 14 Cath
 olics have been canonized and 7 beatified who lived or ministered in the U
 nited States or its territories. By the end of 2026\, Archbishop Fulton Sh
 een and the Georgia Martyrs will join the ranks of the beatified. The temp
 orary exhibit American Saints & Blesseds highlights the virtuous lives of 
 these individuals who the Catholic Church recognizes as intercessors and m
 odels of holiness.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/exhibit-american-
 saints-blesseds-0
