 preeminent voices in contemporary blues. He plays like a man possessed…c
 leverly blending elements of traditional blues\, funk\, Stax-flavored R&B 
 and psychedelic rock into a cohesive and compelling\, expansive and cathar
 tic artistic statement.” –Guitar Player “Birchwood is one of contemp
 orary blues’ foremost innovators. Funky\, Southern-flavored electric blu
 es…infectious rhythms and inventive soloing.” –Blues Music Magazine
 \n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/selwyn-birchwood-0
