DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
DTSTAMP:20260928T182614Z
UID:4fe73c274f5631c32876faae8a18@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The NICE Festival is Connecticut's premier multicultural celeb
 ration\, now marking its 10th anniversary. Held at Oyster Shell Park in No
 rwalk\, this free\, family-friendly event features two stages of live musi
 c and cultural performances spanning Reggae\, Latin\, Rock\, World Music\,
  and more — alongside traditional dance from African\, Flamenco\, Asian
 \, Latin\, and Balinese traditions. With 50+ vendors offering internationa
 l food\, arts\, crafts\, and community services\, there's something for ev
 eryone. Presented by the Norwalk International Cultural Exchange (NICE)\, 
 a volunteer-led nonprofit\, the festival brings together people of all bac
 kgrounds to celebrate the diversity that makes Norwalk and Connecticut so 
 extraordinary.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/10th-annual-nice-fest
 ival
LOCATION:Oyster Shell Park\, 95 N Water St\, Norwalk CT\, 06854
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/10th-annual-nice-festival
END:VEVENT
